# Context = repository root for every image (services/collector, services/control-plane,
# services/webapp). Secrets and local toolchain state must never enter a build context (AD-6).
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
node_modules
**/node_modules
# Root-anchored only: the full WB fixture corpus. NOT `**/fixtures/` — webapp production
# pages (brief, styleguide) import @/lib/fixtures, a recursive mask breaks `next build`.
/fixtures/
_bmad-output/
.planning/
.autopilot/
.codex/
.claude/
.opencode/
.agents/
.bmad/
.openhands/
.githooks/
.github/
.worktrees/
worktrees/
build/
**/build/
**/dist/
**/.next/
**/__pycache__/
.venv/
**/.venv/
.pytest_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
logs/
raw/
secrets/
business-signal-private/
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
provenance/
docs/
*.html
*.md
